{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44555","headline":"诗三百三首 二五二 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二五二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见黄河水，凡经几度清。\n水流如急箭，人世若浮萍。\n痴属根本业，无明烦恼阬。\n轮回几许劫，只爲造迷盲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}